abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of spherical and all-angular radial real-frequency mode
  exclusion, endpoint solution theory, and inhomogeneous estimates for the
  massless charged scalar equation on Reissner–Nordström, based on research
  notes in preparation by Christoph Kehle dated 8 and 9 October 2026.
